         2\\\\n8400000000005000151        广州白云分拨仓      P000151   18.0    20.0   2.0         3\\\\n\\\\n== missing record per warehouse ==\\\\n     仓库  有记录产品数  无记录产品数  无记录占比\\\\n上海浦东中心仓     563     997   63.9\\\\n广州白云分拨仓     454    1106   70.9\\\\n 北京顺义北仓     363    1197   76.7\\\\n 成都双流西仓     323    1237   79.3\\\\n 武汉江夏南仓     305    1255   80.4\\\\ntotal missing combos: 5792\\\\nactive products with no record in ANY wh: 128\\\\nlow combos if missing treated as zero stock: 5905\\\\nproducts with safety<=0: 0 / 1560\\\\nextra gap by unit if zero-treated: {\'袋\': 72389.0, \'盒\': 43483.0, \'瓶\': 26046.0, \'罐\': 17739.0, \'桶\': 4811.0, \'提\': 3881.0, \'包\': 3625.0, \'支\': 2127.0, \'杯\': 1876.0, \'板\': 871.0, \'个\': 867.0, \'件\': 455.0, \'本\': 372.0, \'副\': 208.0, \'把\': 160.0, \'张\': 150.0}\\\\nextra total: 179060.0\\\\n\\\",\\\"bytes\\\":4851,\\\"truncated\\\":false,\\\"saved\\\":false},\\\"files\\\":[],\\\"message\\\":\\\"本次执行完成。\\\"}\", \"callId\": \"call_f8446d742bbf4d28b44f5570\"}','2026-11-22 16:27:25.189090');
