_purchase_price\", \"label\": \"quoted_purchase_price\", \"jdbcType\": -5, \"nullable\": true, \"typeName\": \"BIGINT\"}, {\"name\": \"quote_valid_until\", \"label\": \"quote_valid_until\", \"jdbcType\": 91, \"nullable\": true, \"typeName\": \"DATE\"}, {\"name\": \"min_order_qty\", \"label\": \"min_order_qty\", \"jdbcType\": -5, \"nullable\": false, \"typeName\": \"BIGINT\"}, {\"name\": \"quality_score\", \"label\": \"quality_score\", \"jdbcType\": 4, \"nullable\": true, \"typeName\": \"INT\"}, {\"name\": \"price_score\", \"label\": \"price_score\", \"jdbcType\": 4, \"nullable\": true, \"typeName\": \"INT\"}, {\"name\": \"recommend_score\", \"label\": \"recommend_score\", \"jdbcType\": 4, \"nullable\": true, \"typeName\": \"INT\"}, {\"name\": \"score_status\", \"label\": \"score_status\", \"jdbcType\": 12, \"nullable\": false, \"typeName\": \"VARCHAR\"}, {\"name\": \"last_purchase_at\", \"label\": \"last_purchase_at\", \"jdbcType\": 93, \"nullable\": true, \"typeName\": \"DATETIME\"}, {\"name\": \"avg_delivery_days\", \"label\": \"avg_delivery_days\", \"jdbcType\": 3, \"nullable\": true, \"typeName\": \"DECIMAL\"}, {\"name\": \"status\", \"label\": \"status\", \"jdbcType\": -6, \"nullable\": false, \"typeName\": \"TINYINT\"}], \"rowCount\": 2, \"timeZone\": \"Asia/Shanghai\", \"completed\": true, \"sampleRows\": [[\"8400000000002000001\", \"S0001\", \"上海万隆食品贸易有限责任公司\", \"8400000000005001143\", \"P001143\", \"香满屋 坚果便携装 500g/袋\", \"3072\", \"3120\", \"2027-04-25\", \"200\", 9977, 9994, 9962, \"READY\", \"2026-11-01T08:55:17\", null, 1], [\"8400000000002000002\", \"S0002\", \"佛山宏远商贸有限责任公司\", \"8400000000005001143\", \"P001143\", \"香满屋 坚果便携装 500g/袋\", null, \"3329\", \"2027-04-12\", \"500\", null, null, null, \"NOT_READY\", null, null, 0]], \"currentDate\": \"2026-11-22\", \"limitations\": \"\", \"requirement\": {\"goal\": \"查询产品编码 P001143（香满屋 坚果便携装）在供应商供货产品表中的全部记录，包括供应商ID、供应商名称、最近成交价、人工报价及报价有效期、最小起订量、质量评分、价格评分、推荐评分、评分状态、最近成交时间、平均交期\", \"grain\": \"每个供应商供货产品记录一行\", \"pu