nd_bill_item.source_item_id = sales_order_item.id 关联取单价）。用于计算月度销售退货率分母。\", \"grain\": \"每个确认月份一行\", \"purpose\": \"月度销售退货率趋势的分母\", \"expectedFields\": [\"month\", \"bill_count\", \"qty\", \"amount_yuan\"], \"dataRequirement\": \"FULL\"}, \"supplements\": [], \"needFullData\": true, \"schemaFingerprint\": \"8478e668ddad58adf8e5be7f317aee3f005d298092a4c5de9e147cb0635a8e53\"}','2026-11-22 19:34:49.425457');
